 A group of strangers is given no other choice than to accept the only paying job in this game-like world—the role of a soldier in the Reserve Army—and eliminate anything that threatens the peace in their new world, Grimgar.\n\nWhen all of the stronger candidates join together, those left behind must create a party together to survive: Manato, a charismatic leader and priest; Haruhiro, a nervous thief; Yume, a cheerful hunter; Shihoru, a shy mage; Mogzo, a kind warrior; and Ranta, a rowdy dark knight. Despite its resemblance to one, this is no game—there are no redos or respawns; it is kill or be killed.\n\nIt is now up to this ragtag group of unlikely fighters to survive together in a world where life and death are separated only by a fine line."},"tags":[{"name":"Isekai","rank":94,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Survival","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":76,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Goblin","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":74,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Magic","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Alternate Universe","rank":70,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Philosophy","rank":64,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Amnesia","rank":61,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Dungeon","rank":56,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":55,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Medieval","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Harem","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Grimgar of Fantasy and Ash","english":"Grimgar of Fantasy and Ash","native":"灰と幻想のグリムガル","romaji":"Hai to Gensou no Grimgar","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"灰与幻想的格林姆迦尔"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Grimgar: Ashes and Illusions"}]},"trailer":{"id":"ngLUKREIZMo","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ngLUKREIZMo/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}